message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Topology-Aware Spatio-Temporal Graph RL Autoscaler for Kubernetes Microservices"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic five-service microservice simulator with a safety shield and
  non-RL autoscaling baselines, built as the test bed for a graph-based RL
  autoscaler. No RL code or real Kubernetes yet.
